        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SD-PCF100009SBR, 9 Inch Acrylic Shower Door Pulls</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Acrylic 9 Inch Shower Door Pull Pair is made in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions from the finest acrylic available. The acrylic is manufactured with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading. These are great pulls for glass shower doors and can withstand moist bathroom conditions. Choose from clear or frosted acrylic in your choice of the most popular bathroom finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions SD-PCF100009SBR 9 Inch Acrylic Shower Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear or Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Mounting: 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass doors.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-PCF01009-specifications.pdf?v=1704262232\"><b>First Impressions SD-PCF100009SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—  it can be custom designed to fit your specific door application in lengths up to 6 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Packaged with 2 door pulls, 4 decorative rosettes, and mounting hardware for back-to-back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Acrylic 9 Inch Shower Door Pull",
                "description": "The Acrylic 9 Inch Shower Door Pull Pair is made in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions from the finest acrylic available. The acrylic is manufactured with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading. These are great pulls for glass shower doors and can withstand moist bathroom conditions. Choose from clear or frosted acrylic in your choice of the most popular bathroom finishes.\r\n",
